.TH cmpblockmaps "1" "" "The scalpel3 Blockmap Comparator" "The scalpel3 Blockmap Comparator"

.SH NAME
cmpblockmaps \- Compare two scalpel3 blockmaps

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cmpblockmaps
blockmap_filename_1
blockmap_filename_2

.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\fBcmpblockmaps\fR compares two scalpel3 blockmap files and outputs the differences. Both blockmaps must represent the same number of blocks and have valid block sizes (>= 512 and multiples of 512).

.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This utility takes exactly two positional arguments: the filenames of the two blockmaps to compare.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scalpel3 (1),
.BR crblockmap (1),
.BR modblockmap (1),
.BR blockmapfs (1),
.BR fragmentator (1)

